codex
The root cause is now concrete: this sandbox reports a virtual PID from `getpid()` but exposes executable links only through `/proc/self/exe`; Lean 4.22 hard-codes `/proc/<getpid>/exe`, so its application-path lookup fails. I’m applying a narrowly scoped local compatibility shim that only redirects those executable-link reads to `/proc/self/exe`, then I’ll rerun the unchanged trusted checker. The shim source, compilation, and probes will be retained as audit evidence.
